Description: unofficial Signal client using GTK 4 and libadwaita
 Flare is an unofficial client for the Signal messenger, written in Rust with
 GTK 4 and libadwaita. Its layout adapts to phone screens. It is linked as an
 additional device to an existing Signal account; registration as the primary
 device is experimental.
 .
 The login data are kept in the Secret Service (gnome-keyring or KWallet).
 Audio and video attachments are played through GStreamer.
